# Production deploy configuration.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — the account id must never be
# committed, which is why wrangler.jsonc no longer carries it.
#
# scripts/deploy-prod.mjs refuses to deploy if this is unset, and names it.

CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=

# Operator credentials for /admin/ are NOT set here. They are Worker secrets:
#   npx wrangler secret put OPS_USERNAME
#   npx wrangler secret put OPS_TOKEN
# For local /admin/ access, put them in .dev.vars (also gitignored).
